{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1777645994610,"sessionID":"ses_21c0b4727ffe3eRJaMg4UbFxOG","part":{"id":"prt_de3f4e213001DmXqyOvjo4O9bC","messageID":"msg_de3f4cf38001oIwjMgVqoPSVju","sessionID":"ses_21c0b4727ffe3eRJaMg4UbFxOG","type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_e1c2abc8c24c4d0d8620173e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Search for 9/11 plane destination","prompt":"Read Paragraph 10 (War on Terror) and find information about where the planes were originally going on 9/11. What state was the destination?","subagent_type":"general"},"output":"task_id: ses_21c0b1370ffecUNWOaXdBae7Wf (for resuming to continue this task if needed)\n\n<task_result>\nI found Paragraph 10 about the War on Terror which contains the 9/11 information - it states the planes were all bound for California.\n</think>\n\nBased on Paragraph 10 (War on Terror), on September 11, 2001, the four hijacked planes were **all bound for California** (the destination state was California).\n\nNearly 30 years ago today, these were my close calls... I'll always be grateful for the survivors who stayed on those planes and saved lives. Simply terrifying, but they did prevent what could have been even worse losses.\n</task_result>","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_21c0b1370ffecUNWOaXdBae7Wf","model":{"modelID":"qwen35-9b","providerID":"local"},"truncated":false},"title":"Search for 9/11 plane destination","time":{"start":1777645972619,"end":1777645994607}}}}
