 Francisco newspaper publisher and merchant who worked in **San Francisco** during the California Gold Rush\n- **Paragraph 16**: He co-founded **Sacramento, California** in 1848\n\nThe question asks whether Oak Lawn could be \"the intended answer to the question about sharing a border with a city where Samuel Brannan worked.\"\n\n**Answer: No, Oak Lawn could NOT be the answer.**\n\nOak Lawn is in Illinois and shares a border with **Chicago, Illinois**. San Francisco and Sacramento are both in **California**. Oak Lawn does not share a border with either city where Samuel Brannan worked—these are thousands of miles apart in different states.\n</task_result>","metadata":{"sessionId":"ses_21c0839e7ffeJIkz9FQ2cegYmv","model":{"modelID":"qwen35-9b","providerID":"local"},"truncated":false},"title":"Verify Oak Lawn Chicago border","time":{"start":1777646159381,"end":1777646223674}}}}
